<h3 class='center-h'>
Short-term Goal
</h3>

<p>
We are exploring various approaches to symbolic artificial intelligence and examining how they can enhance game development.  
Our objective is to discover new ways to make the process of creating games more creative, flexible, and inspiring. 
</p>

<h3 class='center-h'>
Long-term Goal
</h3>

<p>
We aim for <b>SymOntoClay</b> to become a powerful and user-friendly tool for game developers.  
It should support the creation of original game worlds, bring enjoyment to players, and foster a developer community.  

We believe that symbolic AI can enrich gameplay and design, and we will continue developing the project to bring this future closer. 
</p>
